---
---
<section id="why-us" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200/60">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-rose-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm block mb-2">
        The Assembly Difference
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase text-slate-900">
        Why Assembly Jiu Jitsu?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Whether you're looking to get in shape, learn self-defense, or compete at the highest level, we have a place for you on our mats.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 text-rose-600">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-slate-900">Fun Environment</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We believe training should be enjoyable. Our community is welcoming, supportive, and focused on helping everyone improve together.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 text-rose-600">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-slate-900">Perfect for Beginners</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Never stepped on a mat before? No problem. We have structured fundamentals classes designed specifically to build your skills safely.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 text-rose-600">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"></path>
            <path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"></path>
            <path d="M4 22h16"></path>
            <path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"></path>
            <path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"></path>
            <path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-slate-900">World-Class Coaching</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Learn from black belts who actively compete, have won championships, and know how to train up champions from scratch.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA Button -->
    <div class="mt-14 text-center">
      <button 
        type="button" 
        class="open-modal-btn btn-primary h-14 px-10 text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-none shadow-xl cursor-pointer"
      >
        Schedule Your Free Class
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
